    "innovation": "This paper introduces the 'planetary boundaries' framework, which identifies and quantifies a set of nine Earth-system processes and associated thresholds that, if crossed, could generate unacceptable environmental change and undermine the safe operating space for humanity.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "loss of mass from the Greenland and West Antarctic ice sheets",
